  "PRIVACY": {
    "TITLE": "Privacy policy",
    "UPDATED": "Last updated: 28 October 2026",
    "BACK": "Back",
    "SECTIONS": [
      {
        "TITLE": "What we collect",
        "BODY": "When you create an account we store your email address and a securely hashed password (never the password itself). We also store the content you create: tasks, groups, your interface language and, if you upload one, your avatar image."
      },
      {
        "TITLE": "Why we use it",
        "BODY": "Your data is used only to provide the app: signing you in, syncing your tasks between devices and sending account emails (address verification and password reset). We do not sell your data, show ads or use it for profiling."
      },
      {
        "TITLE": "Cookies and local storage",
        "BODY": "We use one essential, HttpOnly cookie to keep you signed in. Your device also stores interface preferences (theme, colours, background, language), a cached copy of your avatar and, so the app can show them without a connection, a copy of your tasks, groups and profile, plus the task changes you make offline until they are sent. The app's files are cached as well, so it starts offline. The copy of your data is deleted from the device when you log out or delete your account; if your session expires, unsent task changes stay until you sign in again, and are deleted if another account signs in on the device. No tracking or advertising cookies are used."
      },
      {
        "TITLE": "Location and weather",
        "BODY": "The weather widget asks for your location only with your permission. Coordinates are sent directly from your device to Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com) to fetch the forecast and to BigDataCloud (bigdatacloud.com) to show the name of your town; neither is stored by us. The town name is remembered on your device so it is not looked up again at the same place. You can choose a city instead: its name is searched with Open-Meteo, your device location is not used, and the city is remembered on your device until you switch back to your location."
      },
      {
        "TITLE": "Retention and deletion",
        "BODY": "We keep your data for as long as your account exists. You can delete your account at any time from the account menu (Delete account); this immediately and permanently removes your account, tasks, groups and avatar."
      },
      {
        "TITLE": "Your rights",
        "BODY": "You have the right to access, correct, export and delete your data, and to lodge a complaint with your data protection authority. To exercise these rights, contact the app operator using the contact details given in the app store listing."
      }
    ]
  },
